        </div>
        <p id="analysis-mechanisms" class="text-xs text-body leading-relaxed">
          Operating under AISI 316L molybdenum-bearing metallurgy and FKM Viton® fluoroelastomer seals provides exceptional resistance to 180 ppm equilibrium peracetic acid. The chromium oxide passive layer is fully stable with negligible chloride pitting.
        </p>
